1,4-dibromo-2,5-bis(2-ethylhexyloxy)-3,6-bis(methylsulfanyl)benzene
(10a).3 To a mixture of (9a) (1.00 g, 1.54 mmol) and CH3SNa (0.26 g, 3.6
mmol) was added 20 mL DMF. The resulting mixture was stirred at 100 °C
for 18 hours, after which it was pour into water and extracted with ethyl
ether. After column chromatograph with hex, the product 10a was obtained.
