= 8.1 Hz, J = 1.5 Hz). 13C NMR (50 MHz), δ: 26.0 (CH2); 31.0 (CH2S);
124.8, 126.2, 126.7, 133.6, 136.7 (C(1)); 146.4 (C(2)).
