$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2-(2-Bromophenylsulfanyl)-6-(2-fluorophenyl)benzonitrile (4b).
2-Bromothiophenol (0.140 mL, 1.17 mmol),
2-fluoro-6-(2-fluorophenyl)benzonitrile (7) (240 mg, 1.12 mmol) and
freshly ground K2CO3 (310 mg, 2.23 mmol) were stirred in DMF (2 mL) at
80°C under N2 for 15 hours. At rt sat. NH4Cl (20 mL) was added.
Extraction with Et2O (5×20 mL) and the combined organic phase was washed
once with brine (20 mL). Drying (Na2SO4) and evaporation of the solvent
gave the crude product which was purified by FC (heptane/EtOAc) yielding
336 mg (78%) of 4b as colorless crystals. mp 130-132 °C (heptane/EtOAc),
Rf (heptane/EtOAc 4:1) 0.37. 1H-NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): 7.15 (dd, 1H,
J=8.0, 1.1 Hz), 7.19-7.54 (m, 9H), 7.71 (dd, 1H, J=7.9, 1.4 Hz). 13C-NMR
(75 MHz, CDCl3): 113.8 (s), 115.6 (s), 116.0 (d), 116.2 (d), 124.3 (d(d),
JC-F=3.7 Hz), 125.5 (s(d), JC-F=15.1 Hz), 127.5 (s), 128.4 (d), 129.0
(d(d), JC-F=1.3 Hz), 129.9 (d), 131.0 (d(d), JC-F=8.0 Hz), 131.1 (d(d),
JC-F=2.5 Hz), 132.4 (d), 133.7 (s), 133.8 (d), 134.2 (d), 141.0 (s),
141.3 (s), 159.3 (s(d), JC-F=249 Hz). Anal. Calcd. for C19H11BrFNS: C,
59.33; H, 2.89; N, 3.65. Found: C, 59.53; H, 2.67, N, 3.60.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of Pentacyclic 13-Azadibenzo[a,de]anthracenes via Anionic
Cascade Ring Closure
