$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis and Biological Evaluation of Optimized Inhibitors of the
Mitotic Kinesin Kif18A
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Braun, Joachim; Moeckel, Martin M.; Strittmatter, Tobias; Marx, Andreas;
Groth, Ulrich; Mayer, Thomas U.
